Algoritmo WhosIsYourHusband 
var
    Name1: Caractere
Inicio  
    Escreva ("Enter his name: ")
    Leia (Name1)
    Se (Name1 = "Luiz Gustavo") entao
        Escreva ("This is your beautiful husband")
    Senao
        Escreva ("This is not your husband, and you should be ashamed of yourself!")
    FimSe
FimAlgoritmo